WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
- So, how's the family doing, though?

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.093
What do y'all do for Christmas?

00:00:02.093 --> 00:00:02.926
- They're doing great.

00:00:02.926 --> 00:00:05.670
Well, actually, Michael has been in France

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.860
for what seems like a lifetime,

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.870
shooting a really great project.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.040
But being over there.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.528
So the kids and I actually
surprised him for Thanksgiving.

00:00:15.528 --> 00:00:17.250
He had no idea.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.083
- Oh, that's cool.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:20.190
- And Carys, my daughter,
flew from the East Coast.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.180
I was here with my son.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.760
We flew here, got into the
hotel under the cover of night.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.850
He came home from work and there we were.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:27.683
It was one of those,

00:00:27.683 --> 00:00:29.303
I thought he was gonna have a
heart attack for one minute.

00:00:29.303 --> 00:00:30.421
(audience laughs)

00:00:30.421 --> 00:00:31.837
- [Catherine] He kind of
stumbled back and went,

00:00:31.837 --> 00:00:32.935
"Oh my God," and started crying.

00:00:32.935 --> 00:00:33.960
- Aw.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.210
- It was one of those
great, great, great moments.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.853
- Oh, I love that. I love a good surprise.

